[{"client_msg_id":"08FB4C26-05B4-404D-8358-35B60D9B3E14","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://circleci.com/ja/resources/testing-in-production/|https://circleci.com/ja/resources/testing-in-production/\u003e\nCircleCI社がこんなの出してた","ts":"1620564415.230400","attachments":[{"fallback":"CircleCI: コードをテストするには: CI/CD と本番環境でのテスト","id":1,"title":"コードをテストするには: CI/CD と本番環境でのテスト","title_link":"https://circleci.com/ja/resources/testing-in-production/","text":"本番環境でのテストにおける合理的指針 - コストとリスクを分析し、バリデーション サイクルにおける位置付けについて説明します。","image_url":"https://d3r49iyjzglexf.cloudfront.net/ja/resources/features/ebook-testing-in-production-3613a019a624e12681ef452c0aba8ae759a16587d34f9aa38018e30e4f3e0ecf.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"CircleCI","service_icon":"https://d3r49iyjzglexf.cloudfront.net/ja/apple-touch-icon-f1ef1fb6f37fe36fdacd2dfdc11fb2edf1720083a9aa8648eeac81f0a69e8da8.png","from_url":"https://circleci.com/ja/resources/testing-in-production/","original_url":"https://circleci.com/ja/resources/testing-in-production/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wmC6q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fc45fc2-cdf2-4942-a0b1-07eed7fa28aa","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"実際本番環境のほうが問題わかるもんなぁ","ts":"1620564347.229600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qgRMa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0152818E-B96A-4D4C-8C64-85195A99D01F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"日本だとTesting in Productionとか、まじで理解されないですからね。そのくせデータはでかいし、ステージングと全然違うし。リリース前に洗い出すの到底無理でしょ。","ts":"1620564293.229100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b03c9ea-71cc-4dd0-a6b3-e7e0c02bc71b","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"作って運用始めてからが本番って考え方薄いですよね","ts":"1620563507.225500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"52eRJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45583349-baf5-460a-9843-151da6bc8c27","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"おっ、これは画期的な判決","ts":"1620563490.225100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PvU="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d99524ed-bb01-421e-8cd8-99f6d3c1a8e5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あと日本って注文は付ける割に作ったら作りっぱなしにするきらいがある気がする\nCOCOAもそんな風に言われてましたけど","ts":"1620563373.224800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m74I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4d4ff98-b940-438b-a3cf-3eb04b71b7ed","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"極力そのまま導入できる所がそうやりだしたら\n今日本で言われてるソフトウェアエンジニア不足\nどのくらいマシになるんだろうなぁ・・・","ts":"1620563192.224700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lRsq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13077C9B-B976-4397-AF14-3A8F704BE1B4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"日本はなぜかパッケージをカスタマイズしたがりますからね。","ts":"1620562943.223200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQb9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b559eb1-b600-4614-8d16-44ec81990251","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"後はパッケージソフトって導入する時に\n導入する会社がパッケージソフトに業務のやり方を合わせるほうが一番手間かからないはずで\nパッケージソフトを会社の業務に合わせてカスタマイズするって\nIBMの方が面食らったのでは","ts":"1620562881.222400","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1620562929.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x9k/F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c472245e-8271-4b66-8ed0-8eefc0528b41","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"内容的に\n開発側の提案聞く耳持たず、\n仕様変更だけはバンバン叩きつけてくる\nこれでプロジェクト遅延を開発側のせいとされたら死ぬしか無い\n:innocent:","ts":"1620562647.219900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5G7nL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2465afa0-db64-4058-aaa4-f135023bada3","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"でかいですね","ts":"1620562466.217700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rw5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8EDCD27B-FAE0-48A4-8D5F-16502150BBA9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://xtech.nikkei.com/atcl/nxt/column/18/00001/05552/|https://xtech.nikkei.com/atcl/nxt/column/18/00001/05552/\u003e\n見逃してたけど、これはなかなか大事な判決では？","ts":"1620561108.217400","attachments":[{"fallback":"日経クロステック（xTECH）: 野村HDが日本IBMに逆転敗訴のワケ、「工数削減に応じず変更要求を多発」と指摘","id":1,"title":"野村HDが日本IBMに逆転敗訴のワケ、「工数削減に応じず変更要求を多発」と指摘","title_link":"https://xtech.nikkei.com/atcl/nxt/column/18/00001/05552/","text":"　システム開発の失敗を巡り、野村ホールディングスと野村証券が日本IBMに計約36億円の損害賠償を求めた裁判。2019年3月の一審東京地裁判決では日本IBMに約16億円の支払いを命じたが、2021年4月の控訴審判決で東京高裁は一審判決を変更し、野村側の請求を棄却した。経緯を読み解く。","image_url":"https://xtech.nikkei.com/atcl/nxt/column/18/00001/05552/topm.jpg?191024","blocks":null,"service_name":"日経クロステック（xTECH）","service_icon":"https://xtech.nikkei.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://xtech.nikkei.com/atcl/nxt/column/18/00001/05552/","original_url":"https://xtech.nikkei.com/atcl/nxt/column/18/00001/05552/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jm4"}]}]
